OL,3,GNEWSAMajor A52 delays after empty lorry
OL,4,Afound ablaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists faced major delays after a
OL,7,Florry fire led to closures on a key
OL,8,Froad in Nottinghamshire.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsaid it was called to the fire at
OL,12,FSaxondale Island on the A52 on
OL,13,FWednesday morning.
OL,15,FNottinghamshire Police said the empty
OL,16,Florry was found ablaze at the side of
OL,17,Fthe road, at about 09:55 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
