OL,3,GNEWSAMajor A52 delays after empty lorry
OL,4,Afound ablaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said the A52 was
OL,7,Fclosed in both directions, between the
OL,8,FA46 at Saxondale and the A6011 in
OL,9,FGamston but confirmed at 19:23 all
OL,10,Flanes had reopened.
